    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lifecycle cleanup\n\nUnleash sends a webhook on every flag event. This template picks out the lifecycle events that call for cleanup — **potentially stale** and **completed** — and opens a Jira ticket for the flag's creator.\n\n**Setup in Unleash:** Integrations > Webhook. Point it at this workflow's Production URL and put the same secret in the Authorization field.\n\nDeduplicates on the event **id**, since Unleash retries a failed delivery once and events can arrive twice or out of order.\n\nConnect your own Jira credential and pick a Project and Issue Type.\n\nWorks on every Unleash plan.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 420
      },
